Subject: NoviceQues.,Part2
Message-ID: <6mcSa94SHJk.XhDcH48Sk2EJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/6mcSa94SHJk/m/XhDcH48Sk2EJ>
